# Per-platform native binaries are published as the
# @reventlessdev/reventless-ppx-<target> packages (built once per version by
# .github/workflows/publish-ppx.yml). Local builds via `pnpm build:ppx` land
# here as ppx-<target>.exe and serve as the launcher's local fallback — they
# must never be committed.
#
# ppx-osx-x64.exe remains tracked as a transitional macOS fallback until the
# darwin-* per-platform packages are published — a tracked file is not affected
# by this gitignore (gitignore is for untracked files only).
*.exe
